{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03065",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.67,
      "end_seconds": 5.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Hi, is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.21,
      "end_seconds": 11.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.26,
      "end_seconds": 15.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "It's headaches most days, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.82,
      "end_seconds": 19.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.18,
      "end_seconds": 24.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Since last Tuesday, that's when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.31,
      "end_seconds": 27.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Is it constant or in episodes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.0,
      "end_seconds": 36.84,
      "duration_seconds": 7.84,
      "text": "I'd say a few times a day. I've also had taking painkillers every day, since last weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.99,
      "end_seconds": 52.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Okay, nothing like stiff neck?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.24,
      "end_seconds": 57.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Hmm, not that I've noticed, no stiff neck."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.28,
      "end_seconds": 61.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Have you had any visual changes or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.26,
      "end_seconds": 64.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.23,
      "end_seconds": 72.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.32,
      "end_seconds": 77.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "That's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.96,
      "end_seconds": 80.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.18,
      "end_seconds": 83.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.18,
      "end_seconds": 88.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.87,
      "end_seconds": 100.5,
      "duration_seconds": 11.63,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. I look after my grandchildren most days. I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.97,
      "end_seconds": 111.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.91,
      "end_seconds": 116.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "No, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.8,
      "end_seconds": 121.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "Right, do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.5,
      "end_seconds": 125.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "No, I've always been fairly healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.17,
      "end_seconds": 130.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.35,
      "end_seconds": 147.22,
      "duration_seconds": 15.87,
      "text": "Just a cataract operation in my left eye, about a year ago. I told my wife I'd come today. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.45,
      "end_seconds": 157.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.44,
      "end_seconds": 160.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "No, none."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.3,
      "end_seconds": 164.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.2,
      "end_seconds": 174.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.1,
      "end_seconds": 208.52,
      "duration_seconds": 18.42,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 36.5 degrees, SpO2 97 percent on room air, height 160 centimetres, weight 60 kilos, respiratory rate 18, pressure 126 over 82, pulse is 83 beats a minute, BMI works out to 23.4."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.79,
      "end_seconds": 213.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.69,
      "end_seconds": 217.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.34,
      "end_seconds": 234.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Your neurological examination is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.34,
      "end_seconds": 241.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "All finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.04,
      "end_seconds": 265.31,
      "duration_seconds": 8.27,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, it points towards medication-overuse headache on a background of migraine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 266.23,
      "end_seconds": 269.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.16,
      "end_seconds": 285.89,
      "duration_seconds": 14.73,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with medication-overuse headache on a background of migraine do well once it's treated properly. I'm sending you for a headache diary because of daily headache."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 286.92,
      "end_seconds": 291.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "We have a slot Wednesday at 10 am, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.27,
      "end_seconds": 293.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "That's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.05,
      "end_seconds": 314.49,
      "duration_seconds": 19.44,
      "text": "Let's use amitriptyline, 10 milligrams, at night, long term. It's for headache prevention. Stop the daily painkillers gradually, the headaches may worsen for a couple of weeks first. If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.11,
      "end_seconds": 316.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Okay, makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.25,
      "end_seconds": 322.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "See me again in six weeks. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.27,
      "end_seconds": 325.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    }
  ]
}